# Installing Ansible

## Ubuntu

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install ansible -y
```

Verify installation:

```bash
ansible --version
```

---

## Python Installation

Ansible requires Python.

```bash
python3 --version
```

---

## Verify SSH Connectivity

```bash
ssh ubuntu@SERVER_IP
```

---

## Test Ansible

```bash
ansible all -m ping
```

Expected Output:

```text
SUCCESS
```
